## Profile Schema

参考 `references/profile_schema.json`

## 使用示例

```bash
# 列出所有已注册的 Profile
python3 scripts/profile_registry.py --list

# 注册新的 Profile
python3 scripts/profile_registry.py --register profiles/my-service.json

# 验证 Profile
python3 scripts/profile_registry.py --validate profiles/my-service.json
```
